From e6b1e809fae69bb045d1cd7656f2300c257e9111 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Aryan Khare <aryakhar@qti.qualcomm.com>
Date: Thu, 7 May 2026 15:26:13 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] Read radio temperature from phy00 by using the first
 available hwmon entry. Extract temperature from temp1_input since all hwmon
 entries map to the same PHY.

Signed-off-by: Aryan Khare <aryakhar@qti.qualcomm.com>
---
 .../src/tlvf_airties_utils_nl80211.cpp        | 113 ++++++++++++++++--
 1 file changed, 106 insertions(+), 7 deletions(-)

diff --git a/common/beerocks/multi_vendor/nl80211/src/tlvf_airties_utils_nl80211.cpp b/common/beerocks/multi_vendor/nl80211/src/tlvf_airties_utils_nl80211.cpp
